#. module: bf_federation_process
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_process/models/bf_process.py:0
msgid "Cartographie fédérée avec %s : le tracé complet, ses niveaux, ses couloirs et ses nœuds. Ce qui reste ici : le registre de validation, la prose du livrable, les gels et les écarts."
msgstr "Process map federated with %s: the full drawing, its levels, lanes and nodes. What stays here: the validation register, the deliverable's prose, the freezes and the gaps."

#. module: bf_federation_process
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_federation_process.selection__federation_outbox__kind__process_card
